cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Neural Decoding of Visual Stimuli from Mouse LFP Recordings using Transformer-GRU"
abstract: >
  Deep learning model for neural decoding of visual stimuli from mouse Local Field
  Potential (LFP) recordings using data from the Allen Brain Observatory Visual Coding
  dataset. A Transformer encoder combined with GRU classifies 8 types of visual stimuli
  from time-binned bandpower features extracted from Neuropixels LFP signals in primary
  visual cortex (VISp). Achieves 79.9% test accuracy on 8-way classification.
